  "text": " We were told to trust the science, but trust was betrayed. The vaccine injured were ignored and abandoned. Doctors were threatened and truth-tellers were silenced. I was minding my own business as a high-tech executive in Silicon Valley, the pandemic hit. I looked around for what I could do to make a difference. Founded by tech entrepreneur Steve Kirsch, the Vaccine Safety Research Foundation has challenged government narratives with data, transparency, and courage. According to over 12 studies, the vaccines are killing at least 15 people for every person that it might save. You had this kind of indignation that made you just relentless on this issue. And you've been such a gift to this movement, Steve. Our mission is to advance vaccine safety through scientific research, public education, and advocacy, and to support the vaccine injured. What these injured need is they need to be acknowledged. They need treatment. Multiple doctors tell me they've never seen this before, that it's just a coincidence that it's happening to me now. And the doctor comes in, his incisions aren't even healed up. He's struggling to breathe, and he hands me a form and says, I want to give them nine vaccines today. We've taken the fight public, spreading truth at public hearings, meetings, and gatherings, along with organizing historic events like Defeat the Mandates, DC, and LA, and the COVID litigation conferences. You have to hold these people accountable for their actions. We help fund and amplify courageous films breaking through censorship walls and reaching millions worldwide. And every week we shine light through VSRF Live, now over 200 episodes strong, giving a voice to vaccine injured and medical truth tellers from around the world because informed consent is a human right. This is VSRF. Question everything. Demand truth.",
